  "notes": "Commit = tag jetty-9.4.36.v20210114 (the tree carries the release version). The release was built with JDK 11; JDK 17 activates the same profiles (jdk9: maven-compiler <release>8</release>; jdk11: javadoc options only), so the classes are Java 8 bytecode against the Java 8 API, but javac 17 and javac 11 generate different bytes for some classes (constant-pool order, the synthetic enum $values()), so the class files are not byte-identical to the Central 9.4.36 jars; the classes on the PoC path (QuotedQualityCSV, QuotedCSV, QuotedCSVParser, HttpFields) are javap-equal. -am also builds build-resources, the parents, jetty-jmx and jetty-util-ajax, which are not used. jetty-http: the main jar of maven-jar-plugin (the shade execution's target/benchmarks.jar is not used). Fixed: the five artifacts at 9.4.37.v20210219."
